# Club catalog publish sync (P4-A)

Close the **operator publish → marketing catalog visible** gap (P1 §J / phase-15-closure partial).

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p4/p4-a-catalog-publish.md`](../../TEMP/p4/p4-a-catalog-publish.md) v1.0

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc 9.9 · **P4-A complete** (SV/PW/RV/CP/RR · service + HTTP publish path)

---

## What P4-A actually delivers (honest scope)

| Deliverable                    | Detail                                                                                                                    |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **DRY helper**                 | `maybeScheduleMarketingCatalogRevalidate` — predicate + schedule in one call (no behavior change vs pre-P4-A inline `if`) |
| **Service-layer proof**        | `CanonicalTourService` create/update schedules revalidate (SV-01…SV-06 · urban golden)                                    |
| **Catalog + revalidate proof** | PW-01 service publish → `GET /urban/catalog` + revalidate POST · PW-DN-01 denali seed                                     |
| **Marketing route auth**       | RR-01…RR-04 on `POST /api/revalidate`                                                                                     |
| **Not in P4-A**                | Playwright marketing ISR refresh (P4-D E2E-01 · Architect YES)                                                            |

---

## Executive summary

| Layer                    | P4-A delivers                                                                                                           |
| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Publish gate**         | `publishStatus: active` → public catalog eligibility                                                                    |
| **Cache purge**          | API `maybeScheduleMarketingCatalogRevalidate` → `scheduleMarketingCatalogRevalidate` → marketing `POST /api/revalidate` |
| **Service + HTTP proof** | SV-_ through `CanonicalTourService` · PW-_ through `PATCH /tours` + catalog GET                                         |
| **Integration specs**    | RV/CP helper · SV service · PW HTTP · RR marketing route                                                                |
| **Prod env**             | `MARKETING_REVALIDATE_*` documented as required for prod sync                                                           |

---

## Goals

| Goal                 | Detail                                                                                               |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Publish → list       | Operator sets `active` → tour appears on `apps/marketing` catalog                                    |
| Revalidate all paths | `CanonicalTourService` create + update (scoped memory **and** atomic prisma when `DATABASE_URL` set) |
| Best-effort purge    | Fire-and-forget; tour TX never rolls back on marketing failure                                       |
| Denali + urban       | `publicCatalog.isPublished` workspace hook drives invalidation                                       |

## Non-goals (P4-A v1)

- Real-time websocket push to marketing
- Metadata-only catalog (P3-D) — soft nano P4-A-N-010 after P3-A-N-011
- Urban full marketing product (Denali sufficient for exit)
- Operator UI publish button redesign (wizard review step unchanged)

---

## Industry alignment

| Pattern                    | Source                                                                                                                      | P4-A mapping                            |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| **On-demand ISR**          | [Next.js revalidateTag](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/building-your-application/data-fetching/caching#on-demand-revalidation) | `marketing-catalog-{tenantId}` tag      |
| **Webhook cache purge**    | Headless CMS / composable commerce                                                                                          | API POST → marketing BFF                |
| **Eventual consistency**   | CQRS read models                                                                                                            | Catalog lags seconds; acceptable for v1 |
| **Fail-open side effects** | Side-effect outbox pattern                                                                                                  | Revalidate failure = warn log only      |

---

## Publish gate (frozen)

```text
publicCatalog.isPublished(canonical) === true
  → Denali: data.publishStatus === "active"
  → Urban: publishStatus active on tour root
```

| `publishStatus` | Public catalog | Operator list |
| --------------- | -------------- | ------------- |
| `draft`         | Hidden         | Visible       |
| `active`        | Visible        | Visible       |

Wizard review persists `publishStatus`; operator must set **active** before marketing lists the tour.

---

## M11 revalidate pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Op as Operator PATCH tour
  participant API as apps_api
  participant MKT as apps_marketing

  Op->>API: publishStatus active
  API->>API: persist canonical TX
  API-->>MKT: POST /api/revalidate tenantId
  MKT->>MKT: revalidateTag marketing-catalog-tenantId
```

### Code anchors (verified 2026-06-21)

| Anchor                   | Path                                                                                                                                                                     |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Invalidation predicate   | `apps/api/src/marketing/should-invalidate-marketing-catalog.ts`                                                                                                          |
| Scheduler                | `apps/api/src/marketing/schedule-marketing-catalog-revalidate.ts`                                                                                                        |
| Non-atomic create/update | `apps/api/src/canonical/canonical-tour.service.ts:114,253`                                                                                                               |
| Atomic persist TX        | `atomic-canonical-tour-persist.ts` — no inline revalidate; **`CanonicalTourService`** calls `maybeScheduleMarketingCatalogRevalidate` after atomic create/update returns |
| Shared helper            | `maybe-schedule-marketing-catalog-revalidate.ts` ✅                                                                                                                      |
| Marketing route          | `apps/marketing/app/api/revalidate/route.ts`                                                                                                                             |
| Unit specs               | `apps/api/test/marketing-catalog-revalidate.spec.ts` (MKT-API-11)                                                                                                        |
| Catalog HTTP             | `apps/api/src/http/configure-workspace-denali-product-http-host.ts`                                                                                                      |

### Env contract (prod)

| Variable                      | App             | Role                                   |
| ----------------------------- | --------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `MARKETING_REVALIDATE_URL`    | api             | Marketing origin (no trailing slash)   |
| `MARKETING_REVALIDATE_SECRET` | api + marketing | Header `x-marketing-revalidate-secret` |

Both unset → scheduler **no-op** (local dev OK; prod gap G4).

