## Shared helper (P4-A-N-002)

Extract to avoid drift between persist paths:

```typescript
export function maybeScheduleMarketingCatalogRevalidate(input: {
  workspaceType: string;
  before: CanonicalDocument | null;
  after: CanonicalDocument;
  tenantId: string;
}): void {
  if (!shouldInvalidateMarketingCatalog(input.workspaceType, input.before, input.after)) {
    return;
  }
  scheduleMarketingCatalogRevalidate(input.tenantId);
}
```

Call from **`CanonicalTourService` only** (create + update; covers atomic and scoped persist paths):

- `writeTourInActiveContext` after record persisted
- `updateTourInActiveContext` after atomic or scoped update

