## Testing matrix

| Spec                                       | IDs              | Asserts                                                            |
| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `marketing-catalog-revalidate.spec.ts`     | MKT-API-11…12    | predicate matrix · env no-op                                       |
| `club-catalog-publish-integration.spec.ts` | RV-00…RV-05      | harness · maybeSchedule · urban · env                              |
| `club-catalog-publish-service.spec.ts`     | SV-01…SV-06      | `CanonicalTourService` urban create/update · fail-open · unpublish |
| `club-catalog-publish-service.spec.ts`     | PW-01 · PW-DN-01 | service publish → catalog GET · denali smoke seed                  |
| `revalidate-route.spec.ts`                 | RR-01…RR-04      | 503 · 401 · 400 · authorized reaches revalidateTag                 |
| `catalog-fetch-options.spec.ts`            | MKT-17           | tag shape `marketing-catalog-{tenantId}`                           |

**CP-01…03** — covered by SV-02/SV-03/SV-06 (service layer, not duplicate predicates).

**RV-03** — starter workspace no-op (not «non-atomic parity»).

### SV assertion detail

| ID       | Assert                                            |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| SV-01    | `updateTour` urban draft→published schedules POST |
| SV-02    | `writeTour` urban draft create does not schedule  |
| SV-03    | write then publish schedules exactly one POST     |
| SV-04    | fetch failure → tour still persisted (fail-open)  |
| SV-05    | starter workspace update → no POST                |
| SV-06    | published→draft unpublish still schedules POST    |
| SV-AT-01 | atomic prisma path (skip without `DATABASE_URL`)  |

### PW assertion detail

| ID       | Assert                                                              |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| PW-01    | service publish → `GET /urban/catalog` lists tour + revalidate POST |
| PW-DN-01 | `GET /denali/catalog` lists operator smoke published tour           |

**Memory harness:** `PATCH /tours` (Phase 7.4) uses `requireOperatorSession` → `assertTenantActiveForOperatorLogin`. Without `DATABASE_URL`, tenant status lookup must skip Prisma and treat static dev tenants as active (`null` status). Otherwise operator PATCH returns **500** while direct `CanonicalTourService` calls still pass.

